What it is for: servers in private networks reachable only through a
bastion

Why it helps: one command instead of two logins, keys stay on your
machine, forwards, copies, `run` and paste follow the same path

Why this way: saved hops run through sshr as `ProxyCommand` so each logs
in with its own key or password, a host with a saved password never uses
`-J`, so a plain hop cannot see that password
